+# Glass UI pass 01
+
+This source tree is still Moltorino/Chatterino7. No provider, account, chat,
+7TV, BTTV, FFZ, Twitch, Kick, YouTube, TikTok, or vanity logic was intentionally
+changed in this pass.
+
+Visual changes in this pass:
+- Added a built-in `Glass` theme and made it the fresh-install default.
+- Added dark blue-gray layered surfaces with subtle transparency.
+- Changed polished tabs to separated rounded tabs.
+- Added inset spacing around polished chat splits so each split reads as a card.
+- Rounded the split header top edge and input panel bottom edge.
+- Rounded hover/click effects for custom icon buttons.
+- Restyled the Settings window controls with rounded inputs, buttons, panels,
+  tabs, and scrollbars.
+- Updated the Settings palette to match the Glass theme.
+
+If an existing Moltorino settings profile is reused, its previously selected
+appearance can override the new default. Select `Glass` from the theme picker to
+preview this pass.
+
+Build verification note: CMake configuration was attempted in the editing
+environment, but Qt 6 development packages are not installed there, so a full
+compile was not possible in this environment. The CMake project itself was
+reached successfully up to `find_package(Qt6)`.
